.TH "NETPLAN\-REBIND" "8" "" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
\f[CR]netplan\-rebind\f[R] \- rebind SR\-IOV virtual functions to their
driver
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\f[B]\f[CB]netplan\f[B]\f[R] [\f[I]\-\-debug\f[R]] \f[B]rebind\f[R]
\f[B]\-h\f[R]|\f[B]\-\-help\f[R]
.PP
\f[B]\f[CB]netplan\f[B]\f[R] [\f[I]\-\-debug\f[R]] \f[B]rebind\f[R]
[\f[I]interfaces\f[R]]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
\f[B]\f[CB]netplan rebind [interfaces]\f[B]\f[R] rebinds SR\-IOV virtual
functions of given physical functions to their driver.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\f[CR]\-h\f[R], \f[CR]\-\-help\f[R]
Print basic help.
.TP
\f[CR]\-\-debug\f[R]
Print debugging output during the process.
.TP
\f[CR]interfaces\f[R]
Space\-separated list of physical\-function interface names.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
